### --- TEST SECURE ENDPOINTS WITH SUPER ADMIN TOKEN ---

@token = {{loginSuperAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### 8. Get Current User Details
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Get Patients List (Test Seeded Patient Data)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Get Master Data - Genders
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/masterdata/genders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Get Master Data - Blood Groups
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/masterdata/bloodgroups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Get Master Data - Countries
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/masterdata/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Get Master Data - States
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/masterdata/states
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Get Master Data - Cities
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/masterdata/cities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Get Master Data - Specializations
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/masterdata/specializations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Get Master Data - Categories
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/masterdata/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Get Patient Medical History (Patient ID: 1)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/patients/1/medical-history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Add Patient Medical History (Patient ID: 1)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/patients/1/medical-history
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "diagnosis": "Left Ankle Sprain - Grade II",
  "symptoms": "Swelling, bruising, pain on weight-bearing",
  "treatmentReceived": "RICE protocol, mobilization exercises",
  "remarks": "Patient shows good improvement"
}

### 19. Get Patient Documents Metadata (Patient ID: 1)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/patients/1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Add Patient Document Metadata (Patient ID: 1)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/patients/1/documents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "documentName": "Ankle_XRay_Report.pdf",
  "documentType": "X-Ray",
  "filePath": "/uploads/documents/ankle_xray_1.pdf",
  "fileSize": 1048576
}
